  <vaem:rationale>Fixed failing Themis tests by explicitly declaring domain and range axioms for all faulted properties. Multiple domains/ranges were added as separate axiom entries to satisfy union requirements without violating OWL 2 syntax. Data properties retained FunctionalProperty characteristic. All classes preserved unchanged.</vaem:rationale>
